WEBVTT

00:06:29.418 --> 00:06:31.976
And I learned how to slow
my heart rate down.

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:34.191
I had to remain
perfectly still and just relax

00:06:34.215 --> 00:06:37.976
and think that I wasn't in my body,
and just control that.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.976
And then I learned how to purge.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:42.453
Purging is basically hyperventilating.

00:06:42.477 --> 00:06:43.669
You blow in and out --

00:06:43.693 --> 00:06:47.976
(Breathing loudly)

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:50.977
You do that, you get lightheaded,
you get tingling.

00:06:51.001 --> 00:06:53.306
And you're really ridding
your body of CO2.

00:06:53.330 --> 00:06:56.583
So, when you hold your breath,
it's infinitely easier.

00:06:57.416 --> 00:07:01.019
Then I learned that you have
to take a huge breath,